23:     Swap every sprite to the opposite prototype while preserving scale and position.
24: 
25:     Input structure:
26:     - bg = most common color. Two distinct small sprite patterns (prototypes) appear at various scales.
27:     - Each sprite instance is a scaled copy of one of the two prototypes, placed on the grid.
