29:     Rule:
30:     - Identify the two prototype patterns from the smallest-area sprites.
31:     - For each sprite, determine which prototype it matches and its integer scale factor.
32:     - Replace it with the other prototype at the same scale, aligned by an internal anchor region (color-1 pixels).
